  "description": "GAZHOG crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C128 H144 Nd8 O10 S2 Se16,4(C4 H8 O1). From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 2 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 2 O neighbors; Nd3 (Nd) has 2 O neighbors; Nd4 (Nd) has 1 O neighbors; Nd1B (Nd) has 2 O neighbors; Nd2B (Nd) has 2 O neighbors; Nd3B (Nd) has 2 O neighbors; Nd4B (Nd) has 1 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 4 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.807-3.920 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 116.52-124.63°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula (THF)8Nd8O2S2(SePh)16.",
